{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_71_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_71","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_71_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_71","textTraditional":"八年春王正月，公會王人、齊侯、宋公、衛侯、許男、曹伯、陳世子款盟于洮。鄭伯乞盟。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_71_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_71","textTraditional":"夏，狄伐晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_71_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_71","textTraditional":"秋七月，禘于大廟，用致夫人。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_71_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_71","textTraditional":"冬十有二月丁未，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_71_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_71","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_71_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_71","textTraditional":"八年春，盟于洮，謀王室也。鄭伯乞盟，請服也。襄王定位，而後發喪。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_71_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_71","textTraditional":"晉里克帥師，梁由靡御，虢射為右，以敗狄于采桑。梁由靡曰：「狄無恥，從之，必大克。」里克曰：「拒之而已，無速眾狄。」虢射曰：「期年狄必至，示之弱矣。」夏，狄伐晉，報采桑之役也。復期月。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_71_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_71","textTraditional":"秋，禘而致哀姜焉，非禮也。凡夫人不薨於寢，不殯于廟，不赴于同，不祔于姑，則弗致也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_71_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_71","textTraditional":"冬，王人來告喪，難故也，是以緩。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_71_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_71","textTraditional":"宋公疾，大子茲父固請曰：「目夷長且仁，君其立之。」公命子魚，子魚辭，曰：「能以國讓，仁孰大焉？臣不及也，且又不順。」遂走而退。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}